@page
@model PetrolQueueCalculator.Pages.IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Petrol Station Queue Modeling & Simulation";
}

<!-- App Header -->
<header class="app-header">
  <div class="brand-row">
    <div class="brand-badge"><span class="pump-icon">⛽</span> PETROL STATION QUEUE SYSTEM</div>
    <div class="version-tag">ASP.NET Core (.NET 8)</div>
  </div>
  <h1><span>Petrol Pump</span> Queue Modeling & Simulation</h1>
  <p class="header-subtitle">Stochastic analytical performance analyzer (M/M/1, M/G/1, G/G/1) & customer-by-customer discrete-event simulator (M/M/1, M/M/2).</p>
</header>

<!-- Top Empirical Research & Statistical Model Identification Card (Why G/G/1?) -->
<section class="research-banner" id="researchBanner">
  <div class="research-content">
    <div class="research-header">
      <span class="research-tag">🔬 EMPIRICAL VALIDATION & RESEARCH FINDINGS</span>
      <span class="research-pill badge-model">Confirmed System Model: G/G/1 (c = 1 Pump)</span>
      <span class="research-pill badge-rejected">Poisson Arrival Rejected (&chi;&sup2; = 19.53, p = 0.0006)</span>
    </div>
    
    <div class="research-grid">
      <div class="research-item">
        <strong>1. Chi-Square Goodness-of-Fit Test</strong>
        <p>Tested on 300 vehicles (Final_Data_Transformed.csv). The calculated &chi;&sup2; = 19.53 exceeds critical &chi;&sup2; = 9.49 (p = 0.0006 &lt; 0.05). Poisson memoryless arrivals are strictly rejected due to significant arrival underdispersion (s&sup2; = 2.09 vs &lambda; = 7.54).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="research-item">
        <strong>2. Physical Non-Memoryless Service</strong>
        <p>Refueling vehicles has physical minimum mechanical constraints (parking, opening fuel cap, nozzle dispensing, billing). Service cannot instantaneously complete at t = 0; memoryless exponential service is physically violated.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="research-item">
        <strong>3. Squared Coefficient of Variation (SCV)</strong>
        <p>Arrival SCV C<sub>a</sub>&sup2; = 0.344 and Service SCV C<sub>s</sub>&sup2; = 0.345. Both are far below 1.0 (Exponential requires C&sup2; = 1.0). Therefore, the station follows <strong>General Distributions (G/G/1)</strong> via Sakasegawa approximation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Empirical Reference Cheat Sheet (For Teacher / Viva Questions) -->
    <div class="research-reference-box">
      <span class="ref-title">📊 Empirical Reference Baseline (300 Vehicles, 6 Days):</span>
      <span class="ref-pill">Inter-arrival: <strong>40.15s</strong> (&sigma;<sub>a</sub> = 23.54s, C<sub>a</sub>&sup2; = 0.344)</span>
      <span class="ref-pill">Service: <strong>39.94s</strong> (&sigma;<sub>s</sub> = 23.45s, C<sub>s</sub>&sup2; = 0.345)</span>
      <span class="ref-pill info-pill">💡 Enter your desired test values below to analyze any custom scenario</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Main Navigation Tabs -->
<nav class="nav-tabs">
  <button id="tabAnalyticalBtn" type="button" class="tab-btn active" data-tab="tab-analytical">
    <span class="tab-icon">📐</span>
    <span class="tab-label">Analytical Queueing Models</span>
    <span class="tab-badge">M/M/1 &bull; M/G/1 &bull; G/G/1</span>
  </button>
  <button id="tabSimulationBtn" type="button" class="tab-btn" data-tab="tab-simulation">
    <span class="tab-icon">🎲</span>
    <span class="tab-label">Discrete-Event Simulator</span>
    <span class="tab-badge">M/M/1 &bull; M/M/2 Trace & Gantt</span>
  </button>
</nav>

<!-- ========================================================================= -->
<!-- TAB 1: ANALYTICAL QUEUEING MODELS (M/M/1, M/G/1, G/G/1)                  -->
<!-- ========================================================================= -->
<div id="tab-analytical" class="tab-pane active">
  <div class="layout">
    <!-- Left Column: Input Configuration -->
    <section class="panel input-panel">
      <div class="panel-header">
        <h2>Model Configuration</h2>
        <span class="panel-hint">Steady-State Formulas</span>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="model">Queueing Model
          <select id="model">
            <option value="MM1">M/M/1 (Poisson arrivals, Exponential service)</option>
            <option value="MG1">M/G/1 (Poisson arrivals, General service)</option>
            <option value="GG1" selected>G/G/1 (General arrivals, General service - Confirmed)</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>

      <!-- Arrival Card -->
      <div class="sub-panel">
        <div class="sub-panel-title">
          <span class="dot-indicator dot-arr"></span>
          <span id="arrLegend">Arrival Process</span>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row two-col">
          <label>Time unit
            <select id="arrUnit">
              <option value="seconds">Seconds (s)</option>
              <option value="minutes" selected>Minutes (min)</option>
              <option value="hours">Hours (hr)</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>Input type
            <select id="arrType">
              <option value="time">Mean Time</option>
              <option value="rate">Rate (&lambda;)</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <label><span id="arrValueLabel">Mean inter-arrival time</span>
            <input id="arrValue" type="number" step="any" min="0" placeholder="Enter value (e.g. 40.15)">
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row" id="arrSdRow">
          <label><span id="arrSdLabel">Standard deviation (&sigma;<sub>a</sub>)</span>
            <input id="arrSd" type="number" step="any" min="0" placeholder="Enter std deviation (e.g. 23.54)">
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Service Card -->
      <div class="sub-panel">
        <div class="sub-panel-title">
          <span class="dot-indicator dot-svc"></span>
          <span id="svcLegend">Service Process</span>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row two-col">
          <label>Time unit
            <select id="svcUnit">
              <option value="seconds">Seconds (s)</option>
              <option value="minutes" selected>Minutes (min)</option>
              <option value="hours">Hours (hr)</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>Input type
            <select id="svcType">
              <option value="time">Mean Time</option>
              <option value="rate">Rate (&mu;)</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <label><span id="svcValueLabel">Mean service time</span>
            <input id="svcValue" type="number" step="any" min="0" placeholder="Enter value (e.g. 39.94)">
          </label>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row" id="svcSdRow">
          <label><span id="svcSdLabel">Standard deviation (&sigma;<sub>s</sub>)</span>
            <input id="svcSd" type="number" step="any" min="0" placeholder="Enter std deviation (e.g. 23.45)">
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="displayUnit">Output Display Unit
          <select id="displayUnit">
            <option value="seconds">Seconds</option>
            <option value="minutes" selected>Minutes</option>
            <option value="hours">Hours</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>

      <div class="buttons">
        <button id="calcBtn" type="button" class="primary-btn">
          <span>Calculate Metrics</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button id="clearBtn" type="button" class="ghost-btn">Clear</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Right Column: Results & Performance Insights -->
    <section class="panel result-panel" id="resultPanel">
      <div class="panel-header">
        <h2>Queue Performance Results</h2>
        <span id="systemStatus" class="status-badge status-ready">Ready</span>
      </div>

      <p id="message" class="message">Enter arrival and service values on the left and click Calculate Metrics.</p>

      <!-- Gauge Widget -->
      <div id="gaugeBox" class="gauge-container" hidden>
        <div class="gaugeHead">
          <div class="gauge-title-wrap">
            <span class="gauge-icon">📊</span>
            <span>Pump Utilization (&rho;)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="gauge-val-wrap">
            <strong id="gaugeText">0.0%</strong>
            <span id="gaugeStatusPill" class="gauge-pill pill-ok">Optimal</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="gauge">
          <div id="gaugeFill"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="gauge-scale">
          <span>0% (Empty)</span>
          <span>50%</span>
          <span>75%</span>
          <span>100% (Saturated)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 6 Clean Result Metric Cards -->
      <div id="cards" class="cards"></div>

      <!-- Step-by-Step Math Formulation -->
      <div id="stepsBox" class="steps-box" hidden>
        <div class="steps-head">
          <span class="steps-title">📝 Step-by-Step Mathematical Derivations:</span>
        </div>
        <ol id="stepsList" class="steps-list"></ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ========================================================================= -->
<!-- TAB 2: DISCRETE-EVENT SIMULATOR (M/M/1, M/M/2 WITH TRACE & GANTT)        -->
<!-- ========================================================================= -->
<div id="tab-simulation" class="tab-pane">
  <div class="sim-container">
    <!-- Simulation Config Row -->
    <section class="panel sim-input-panel">
      <div class="panel-header">
        <div>
          <h2>Discrete Simulator Configuration</h2>
          <p class="sim-header-desc">Customer-by-customer Monte Carlo simulation with random inverse transforms, trace table, and Gantt chart.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sim-model-selector">
          <button type="button" class="model-toggle-btn active" data-sim-model="MM1">M/M/1 (1 Pump)</button>
          <button type="button" class="model-toggle-btn" data-sim-model="MM2">M/M/2 (2 Pumps)</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sim-grid-inputs">
        <!-- Time Unit Selector -->
        <div class="sim-unit-row">
          <span class="input-inline-label">Time Unit:</span>
          <div class="btn-group-toggle" id="simTimeUnitGroup">
            <button type="button" class="btn-toggle" data-unit="hours">Hours</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-toggle" data-unit="minutes">Minutes</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-toggle active" data-unit="seconds">Seconds</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sim-two-col">
          <!-- Arrival Input Block -->
          <div class="sim-card">
            <div class="sim-card-header">
              <span class="sim-card-title">👥 Vehicle Arrivals (&lambda;)</span>
              <div class="btn-group-toggle small" id="simArrTypeGroup">
                <button type="button" class="btn-toggle" data-type="rate">Rate (&lambda;)</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn-toggle active" data-type="time">Mean Time</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
              <label>
                <span id="simArrLabel">Mean inter-arrival time (sec)</span>
                <input id="simArrValue" type="number" step="any" min="0" placeholder="e.g. 1.5">
              </label>
            </div>
            <span class="sim-hint" id="simArrHint">&lambda; is arrival rate per unit. Mean inter-arrival = 1/&lambda;.</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Service Input Block -->
          <div class="sim-card">
            <div class="sim-card-header">
              <span class="sim-card-title">⛽ Pump Service (&mu;)</span>
              <div class="btn-group-toggle small" id="simSvcTypeGroup">
                <button type="button" class="btn-toggle active" data-type="time">Mean Time</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn-toggle" data-type="rate">Rate (&mu;)</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
              <label>
                <span id="simSvcLabel">Mean service time (sec)</span>
                <input id="simSvcValue" type="number" step="any" min="0" placeholder="e.g. 2.3">
              </label>
            </div>
            <span class="sim-hint" id="simSvcHint">&mu; is service rate per pump. Mean = 1/&mu;.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Simulation Run Settings -->
        <div class="sim-settings-bar">
          <div class="setting-item">
            <label for="simCustomerCount">Number of Vehicles (Customers):
              <input id="simCustomerCount" type="number" min="3" max="200" value="10">
            </label>
          </div>
          <div class="setting-item">
            <label for="simSeed">Random Seed (Optional):
              <input id="simSeed" type="number" placeholder="Random">
            </label>
          </div>
          <div class="sim-action-buttons">
            <button id="runSimBtn" type="button" class="primary-btn">
              <span>🚀 Run Simulation</span>
            </button>
            <button id="randomRunBtn" type="button" class="ghost-btn">
              <span>🎲 New Random Run</span>
            </button>
            <button id="clearSimBtn" type="button" class="ghost-btn">Clear</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Simulation Results Section (Friend's Layout) -->
    <section class="panel sim-result-panel" id="simResultPanel" hidden>
      <!-- Results Top Bar -->
      <div class="sim-res-header">
        <div class="sim-title-group">
          <h2>Simulation Results</h2>
          <span class="sim-badge badge-complete">✓ Simulation Complete</span>
          <span id="simModelBadge" class="sim-badge badge-model">M/M/1</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sim-clock-summary">
          <span>Total Simulated Clock: <strong id="simTotalTime">0.00</strong> <span class="sim-unit-txt">sec</span></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Utilization Bar -->
      <div class="sim-util-box">
        <div class="sim-util-header">
          <span class="sim-util-label">Overall Server Utilization (&rho;)</span>
          <strong id="simUtilVal" class="sim-util-value">0.00%</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="gauge">
          <div id="simUtilFill" class="sim-gauge-fill"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sim-util-meta">
          <span id="simUtilFormula">&rho; = &Sigma;Service / (c &times; T) &bull; 10 customers</span>
          <span id="simServerBreakdown" class="sim-server-breakdown" hidden></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Theory vs Simulation Alert Box -->
      <div id="simTheoryAlert" class="sim-theory-alert"></div>

      <!-- Three Category Metric Cards -->
      <div class="sim-metric-cols">
        <!-- 1. In Waiting Line -->
        <div class="sim-stat-card">
          <h3 class="stat-card-title">IN THE WAITING LINE</h3>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Average queue length (L<sub>q</sub>)</span>
            <strong id="simLqVal" class="stat-num">0.0000</strong>
            <span class="stat-unit">vehicles</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Average waiting time (W<sub>q</sub>)</span>
            <strong id="simWqVal" class="stat-num">0.0000</strong>
            <span class="stat-unit sim-unit-txt">sec</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Average response time</span>
            <strong id="simResponseTimeVal" class="stat-num">0.0000</strong>
            <span class="stat-unit sim-unit-txt">sec</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. In The Whole System -->
        <div class="sim-stat-card">
          <h3 class="stat-card-title">IN THE WHOLE SYSTEM</h3>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Average # in system (L)</span>
            <strong id="simLVal" class="stat-num">0.0000</strong>
            <span class="stat-unit">vehicles</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Average turnaround time (W)</span>
            <strong id="simWVal" class="stat-num">0.0000</strong>
            <span class="stat-unit sim-unit-txt">sec</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Total simulated time (T)</span>
            <strong id="simTotalSimVal" class="stat-num">0.00</strong>
            <span class="stat-unit sim-unit-txt">sec</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Arrivals, Service & Vehicles -->
        <div class="sim-stat-card">
          <h3 class="stat-card-title">ARRIVALS, SERVICE & VEHICLES</h3>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Avg inter-arrival time</span>
            <strong id="simAvgInterArrVal" class="stat-num">0.00</strong>
            <span class="stat-unit sim-unit-txt">sec</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Avg service time</span>
            <strong id="simAvgSvcVal" class="stat-num">0.00</strong>
            <span class="stat-unit sim-unit-txt">sec</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Vehicles who waited</span>
            <strong id="simWaitedVal" class="stat-num">0 / 0</strong>
            <span id="simWaitedPct" class="stat-unit">(0.0%)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Maximum wait in queue</span>
            <strong id="simMaxWaitVal" class="stat-num">0.00</strong>
            <span class="stat-unit sim-unit-txt">sec</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Maximum queue length</span>
            <strong id="simMaxQueueVal" class="stat-num">0</strong>
            <span class="stat-unit">vehicles</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Simulation Trace Table -->
      <div class="trace-container">
        <div class="trace-head">
          <div class="trace-title-group">
            <h3>Simulation Trace Table</h3>
            <span class="trace-sub" id="traceSubTitle">(10 vehicles, times in sec)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="trace-actions">
            <button id="copyTraceBtn" type="button" class="ghost-btn small">📋 Copy Table</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="table-scroll">
          <table class="sim-table" id="traceTable">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>#</th>
                <th>RANDOM (ARR)</th>
                <th>INTER-ARRIVAL</th>
                <th>ARRIVAL CLOCK</th>
                <th>RANDOM (SVC)</th>
                <th>SERVICE TIME</th>
                <th id="thServer">SERVER</th>
                <th>START</th>
                <th>END</th>
                <th>TURNAROUND (W)</th>
                <th>WAIT (Wq)</th>
                <th>IDLE TIME</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="traceTableBody"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Interactive Gantt Chart Timeline -->
      <div class="gantt-container">
        <div class="gantt-header">
          <div class="gantt-title-group">
            <h3>Visual Gantt Chart</h3>
            <span class="gantt-sub" id="ganttSubTitle">(Customer service timelines across pumps)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="ganttChart" class="gantt-chart"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
